#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:5
#: f034c3ac50f64b4aa9a8cf079ebf0452
msgid "Packet Digital MPPT"
msgstr "Packet Digital MPPT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:10
#: 88c33ff29a934823977c9f53a4df2948
msgid ""
"The `Packet Digital MPPT solar controller "
"<https://www.packetdigital.com/maximum-power-point-tracker/>`__ is "
"specifically designed to help extend the range of unmanned vehicles through "
"the use of solar panels.  This light weight controller includes a "
"DroneCAN/DroneCAN interface allowing real-time monitoring of the solar "
"system's performance."
msgstr ""
"`Packet Digital MPPT 太阳能控制器 <https://www.packetdigital.com/maximum-power-"
"point-tracker/>`__ 专为通过太阳能电池板延长无人飞行器续航而设计。这款轻量化控制器内置 DroneCAN "
"接口，可实时监控太阳能系统的性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:12
#: 4e84cff62b2b426abe96d9d59a84186b
msgid ""
"Normally, a conventional, bi-directional power monitor would also be "
"included in this system directly on the battery's output to monitor the "
"battery's current flow, either charging or discharging, and total consumed "
"current of the battery."
msgstr "通常情况下，系统中还会在电池输出端直接接入一个传统双向电源监控器，用于监测电池的充放电电流及总消耗电量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:15
#: 6d2ee3048ac34cb29d7760e914dac0ad
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:17
#: 288da9cf48884f73bdec6361399510e3
msgid ""
"`Contact PacketDigital <https://www.packetdigital.com/contact/>`__ directly "
"for pricing"
msgstr "直接 `联系 PacketDigital <https://www.packetdigital.com/contact/>`__ 询价"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:20
#: 2a6ac53580bd447292e54f9b3a09a490
msgid "Specifications"
msgstr "规格"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:22
#: 4049ec337ff846e790413a804dcc5e40
msgid "Input Voltage: 12.5V to 50V"
msgstr "输入电压：12.5V 至 50V"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:23
#: 7a3e94fd93224ecdb4982b9b99fa3804
msgid "Output Voltage: Up to 50V"
msgstr "输出电压：最高 50V"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:24
#: ad5d4c57153444b6a54b0ce2bfe8185c
msgid "Input/Output Current Max: 5A"
msgstr "输入/输出最大电流：5A"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:25
#: e2cd8dec7418418fad325da1ae11d402
msgid "Size: 60.96mm x 53.34mm x 17.4mm (LxWxH)"
msgstr "尺寸：60.96mm x 53.34mm x 17.4mm（长 x 宽 x 高）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:26
#: 9b8e8f25943748a59540cfdaf699f9bb
msgid "Weight: 31g"
msgstr "重量：31g"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:28
#: 0b02c7b713b640efa6c4645850208b38
msgid ""
"For more details please see `packetdigital.com "
"<https://www.packetdigital.com/maximum-power-point-tracker/>`__"
msgstr ""
"更多详情请参阅 `packetdigital.com <https://www.packetdigital.com/maximum-power-"
"point-tracker/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:31
#: da807baeb07147ebbef25545bee30153
msgid "Autopilot Connection"
msgstr "飞控连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:37
#: ef08f74bd6e349a0abdea2572ba4a001
msgid "Connect the solar panel, MPPT, battery and autopilot as shown above."
msgstr "按上图所示连接太阳能电池板、MPPT、电池和飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:39
#: 89a727d430864bc782629042f27deb85
msgid ""
"Once the solar panel provides more than 12V the board's LED should flash "
"green.  Initially it may be easiest to connect a 4S or 6S battery to the "
"board's VIN port."
msgstr "当太阳能电池板提供超过 12V 电压时，板卡 LED 应闪绿灯。初期最简便的方式是将 4S 或 6S 电池连接到板卡的 VIN 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:42
#: 1070aa2c68fd423099e89ed1f4ae1c0a
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:44
#: 88432a5b6d414a9d941cae246b2491b4
msgid ""
"Connect a ground station (e.g. Mission Planner) to the autopilot and set the"
" following parameters and then reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "将地面站（如 Mission Planner）连接到飞控，设置以下参数后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:46
#: dd81ff40f93e411d9e11c56ca6f819ea
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` = 8 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` = 8（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:47
#: b2479fce0e204ac9ae5b3566ea4593d6
msgid ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:48
#: 9587c441288340d289af752ddddabb32
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_OPTIONS<BATT_OPTIONS>` provides several options for MPPT enable "
"and disable depending on autopilot events."
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_OPTIONS<BATT_OPTIONS>` 提供了多个选项，用于根据飞控事件启用或禁用 MPPT。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:50
#: 107cf53f935c40dab99cbd5a37321e01
msgid ""
"the MPPT can be manually turned on or off using an RC channel switch setup "
"with its ``RCx_OPTION`` = 172."
msgstr "MPPT 可通过 RC 通道开关手动开启或关闭，将其 ``RCx_OPTION`` 设置为 172。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:52
#: 9cfec7a34b1c4455b374bd6eddd6ab7b
msgid "Check the MPPT board's parameters by connecting through \"SLCAN\""
msgstr "通过「SLCAN」连接检查 MPPT 板的参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:54
#: 89b2d8a43e9a4d579581ac0667868e5c
msgid ""
"Open Mission Planner's SETUP >> Optional Hardware >> UAVCAN(DroneCAN) page"
msgstr ""
"打开 Mission Planner 的 SETUP >> Optional Hardware >> UAVCAN(DroneCAN) 页面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:55
#: 017804e7e1b14f1a96f083b9f42756fc
msgid ""
"From the top right, select the COM port for the autopilot's SLCAN connection"
" (normally one higher than the MAVLink COM port)"
msgstr "在右上角选择飞控 SLCAN 连接的 COM 端口（通常比 MAVLink COM 端口高一个编号）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:56
#: 513cd1fc2bed47f9a9a9d123ca17ce2b
msgid ""
"Press the \"SLCan Mode CAN1\" button. The table should be filled in as shown"
" below.  If this does not work try changing to the Config screen, connect "
"over MAVLink and set :ref:`CAN_SLCAN_CPORT <CAN_SLCAN_CPORT>` = 1.  Return "
"to SETUP >> Optional Hardware >> UAVCAN(DroneCAN) page and press the \"SLCan"
" Mode CAN1\" button again"
msgstr ""
"按「SLCan Mode CAN1」按钮。表格应如下图所示填充完成。如果无效，请尝试切换到 Config 界面，通过 MAVLink 连接并将 "
":ref:`CAN_SLCAN_CPORT <CAN_SLCAN_CPORT>` 设置为 1。然后返回 SETUP >> Optional "
"Hardware >> UAVCAN(DroneCAN) 页面，再次按「SLCan Mode CAN1」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:62
#: 28bb6288c18c49b5b72522a3106fd5de
msgid "Press the \"Menu\" button to view or change some of the MPPT's settings"
msgstr "按「Menu」按钮查看或更改部分 MPPT 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:64
#: 9c9fdb072a3a44a5974983af6f4871d8
msgid ""
"mppt.vout_set configures the maximum voltage from the VOUT pin.  This should"
" be equal to the battery's voltage when fully charged."
msgstr "mppt.vout_set 配置 VOUT 引脚的最大输出电压。该值应等于电池充满时的电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:65
#: 33227d66892046a085e5f3d2edeeb8dc
msgid ""
"mppt.dcdc_en configures the board's startup behaviour.  If \"0\" the MPPT "
"will not charge the battery until the autopilot is armed.  If \"1\" the MPPT"
" will always attempt to charge the battery"
msgstr "mppt.dcdc_en 配置板卡的启动行为。若为「0」，MPPT 在飞控解锁前不会为电池充电。若为「1」，MPPT 将始终尝试为电池充电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:66
#: 6b34f4217fb54524a7dd7683818e1661
msgid ""
"uavcan.node_id should normally be left at \"0\" to allow the autopilot to "
"dynamically allocate the MPPT's DroneCAN node id but if multiple DroneCAN "
"battery monitors or MPPTs are used you can manually set this to some value "
"between 0 and 127 (e.g. \"50\") and then set :ref:`BATT_SERIAL_NUM "
"<BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` to the same number"
msgstr ""
"uavcan.node_id 通常应保持「0」以允许飞控动态分配 MPPT 的 DroneCAN 节点 ID，但如果使用多个 DroneCAN "
"电池监控器或 MPPT，您可以手动将其设置为 0 到 127 之间的某个值（如「50」），然后将 :ref:`BATT_SERIAL_NUM "
"<BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` 设置为相同数字"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:69
#: 3e24cb434b4c4bd58315d593e355ea81
msgid "Connecting more than one MPPT"
msgstr "连接多个 MPPT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:71
#: a2e2d9cc26554a8abac9173b6f24f948
msgid ""
"More than one Packet Digital MPPT board can be connected in parallel to the "
"same battery (but different solar panels) to increase the total current "
"provided."
msgstr "可以将多个 Packet Digital MPPT 板并联到同一电池（但连接不同的太阳能电池板），以增加总输出电流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:73
#: 2a395a42688148098c77f27cdc640547
msgid "To allow the autopilot to connect to all the MPPTs:"
msgstr "要让飞控连接到所有 MPPT："

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:75
#: c1b377d965924e229a811e49276ffee0
msgid ""
"Enable one battery monitor per MPPT by setting :ref:`BATTx_MONITOR "
"<BATT_MONITOR>` = 8"
msgstr "为每个 MPPT 启用一个电池监控器，将 :ref:`BATTx_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` 设置为 8"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:76
#: d884793bf1cd4e1bba8c877433dc3bf4
msgid ""
"Use Mission Planner's SETUP >> Optional Hardware >> UAVCAN(DroneCAN) page's "
"\"Menu\" button to manually configure the uavcan.node_id of each MPPT"
msgstr ""
"使用 Mission Planner 的 SETUP >> Optional Hardware >> UAVCAN(DroneCAN) "
"页面的「Menu」按钮手动配置每个 MPPT 的 uavcan.node_id"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:77
#: a532f2daefd446e5ac548575e342bebb
msgid ""
"set :ref:`BATTx_SERIAL_NUM <BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` to match the uavcan.node_ids "
"set above."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BATTx_SERIAL_NUM <BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` 设置为与上面设置的 uavcan.node_id 匹配。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:78
#: 26f34fbcf3c14e33b0349b150263e6f1
msgid ""
"You can sum all the MPPT currents using a \"SUM (10)\" power monitor type. "
"See :ref:`common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner`."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用「SUM (10)」类型的电源监控器对所有 MPPT 电流求和。请参阅 :ref:`common-power-module-"
"configuration-in-mission-planner`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:81
#: 5b1ce2db051049fc86c9b99c7c845214
msgid "Videos"
msgstr "视频"
